{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/767754-hard-book-are-heavy-pdf-are-good-for-pc-but-what-about-e-reader-and-epub","id":767754,"title":"Hard book are heavy, pdf are good for PC but what about e-reader and epub?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-17T05:15:50-08:00","id":767754,"title":"Hard book are heavy, pdf are good for PC but what about e-reader and epub?","content":"Hello people from Onyx Path,<br /> <br /> sorry for my English but I am French so it might be badly worded,<br /> I am a Vampire the masquerade storyteller and I like that you made a pdf version of the books, because V20 is kind of heavy and searching by keyword is far more easier on a computer than in a book.<br /> However, there are now device that are the best of both world, the e-reader. I would like to know if it is hard to make an epub version of a book and if it might be considered an option for the existing books or the next ones (especially for the 20 anniversary edition or the V4 of the masquerade), because the e-reader can not read pdf as big as the one you made. (Which are nice work).<br /> <br /> Best regards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8693-pilodermann","name":"Pilodermann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8693_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T05:39:56-08:00","id":767768,"title":"","content":"Most of their new fiction books come in e-reader formats, and the 99% complete texts from the Kickstarters you can put onto e-readers.<br /> <br /> But I agree, having access to more books on e-readers would b e great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T14:03:49-08:00","id":768084,"title":"","content":"It's probably not going to happen.<br /> <br /> You can't just click a button in some layout software and have a pdf or other text file (even if you just took the raw manuscript without the art and all that) turn into a finished epub file. It's a lot of work to make right. There's a lot of work in redoing the book's charts, tables of contents, index, and page references (especially since those are all basically useless in epub).<br /> <br /> Hell, making tables in epub alone is a gigantic pain in the ass. There's pretty much no way to make it so that the table consistently looks right for every reader, in every size, and so one.<br /> <br /> I think, if we're going to try to campaign for something, it should be for &quot;flatter&quot; pdfs where a lot of the artistic quality is reduced in the name of functionality and lower file size; specifically for use at tables on things like tablets and phablets. A decent pdf reader on a tablet, with a pdf more optimized for that application, is much more reasonable than remaking the whole book in an epub file.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T14:26:03-08:00","id":768101,"title":"","content":"Anarchs Unbound is, I think, the only supplement currently available in e-reader format, specifically epub.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}